==English==

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# [[illness|Illness]] caused by a previous bout of [[heavy drinking]].
#: ''I really enjoyed yesterday's party, but now I have the biggest '''hangover''' &mdash; I'll not be doing that again any time soon.''
# An unpleasant [[relic]] left from prior events.

